{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chilling world of <i>Obscura Protocol</i>, a psychological horror game where observation is your only defense. Hired by the mysterious company Obscura, your task is simple: Monitor various locations through live camera feeds and report anomalies before they spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing is ever truly simple. Each location hides its own horrors, whether it's a sleek modern mansion, a desolate mining site, or the eerie remnants of Forsaken City. Flickering lights, distorted figures, objects shifting without reason, every report matters, and missing a single anomaly could be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Vision Modes:</strong> Switch between <strong>Night Vision, Thermal Vision,</strong> and Standard View to spot disturbances that would otherwise go unnoticed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/c86833f2de15632321455be58d302687.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/c86833f2de15632321455be58d302687.webm?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/c86833f2de15632321455be58d302687.mp4?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Locations:</strong> Monitor unsettling environments, each with their own secrets and threats.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/b41b1a8c0ce8ce0121739a708850ece3.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 heigh